        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Reguitti SDK092PA Modern Square Pocket Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll new modern square sliding pocket door passage set that offers both fashion and high quality function. Packaged as a complete pocket door pull set that includes two (2) square flush pulls and a square edge pull. Made in Italy by Reguitti.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 3 high quality finishes and fit both <b>1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" thick pocket doors</b>. The flush pulls have a very low 1/16\" projection off the surface of the door, so they are suitable for use on tight pocket doors (sliding door with minimal clearance with its wall pocket).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe square edge pull is pressure mounted into the door's edge. The square flush pulls are pressure mounted into the door's face - no screws show for a clean contemporary appearance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-square-pocket-lock-privacy-reguitti-sdk092pv\"><b>Modern Square Pocket Door Lock</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-square-double-pocket-door-lock-set-reguitti-sdk092pv-pa\"><b>Modern Square Double Pocket Door Lock Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the SDK092PA Modern Square Pocket Door Passage Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 2-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Diameter: 1-7/8\" (48 mm)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/contemporary-square-fingertip-edge-pull-ahi-ep1273\">Edge Pull</a> Diameter: 1-1/8\" Square</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDK092PA.pdf?v=1691093347\" target=\"new\"><b>SDK092PA Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) square flush pulls and a square edge pull. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
